Subject: [PATCH 3/8] windows.devices.bluetooth: Add BluetoothUuidHelper.

Implement the FromShortId and TryGetShortId statics, which convert
between 16/32-bit Bluetooth SIG IDs and full UUIDs based on the
Bluetooth base UUID.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
